tudio.maxpfennighaus.workers.dev/","children":"Edit"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-The mainstream minimalist web is about subtraction from an otherwise conventional affluent life: decluttering, capsule wardrobes, screen-time reduction, etc. Lots of Instagram-worthy photos of white space and blonde wood.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["The mainstream minimalist web is about subtraction from an otherwise conventional affluent life: decluttering, capsule wardrobes, screen‑time reduction, etc. Lots of Instagram‑worthy photos of white space and blonde wood."]}],["$","p","1-But the much more interesting minimalism material out there is about designing a life whose requirements are intrinsically small. Deep Minimal.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["But the much more interesting minimalism material out there is about designing a life whose requirements are intrinsically small. Deep Minimal."]}],["$","$L10","2-/images/deep-minimal-d76dc09e.webp",{"type":"image","index":2,"alt":"An illustration of a minimal house with roots growing into the ground","src":"/images/deep-minimal-d76dc09e.webp","title":"$undefined"}],["$","p","3-[100 Rabbits](https://100r.co/) needs less because the boat imposes constraints. [Hiker Backpacker](https://hackerbikepacker.com/) needs less because everything has to travel on a bicycle. [MiniMotives](https://minimotives.com/) asks how much house is actually necessary. [Low-tech Magazine](https://solar.lowtechmagazine.com/) asks how much technology and energy are actually necessary. [3 Mules](https://3mules.com/) has roamed the western U.S. with a few mules nonstop for sonething like *40 years.*",{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://100r.co/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["100 Rabbits"]}]," needs less because the boat imposes constraints. ",["$","a","2",{"href":"https://hackerbikepacker.com/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Hiker Backpacker"]}]," needs less because everything has to travel on a bicycle. ",["$","a","4",{"href":"https://minimotives.com/","rel":"noreferrer","children":"$L11"}]," asks how much house is actually necessary. ","$L12"," asks how much technology and energy are actually necessary. ","$L13"," has roamed the western U.S. with a few mules nonstop for sonething like ","$L14"]}],"$L15","$L16","$L17"],null,"$L18"]}],"$L19","$L1a"]}]]}]]}]
