15:["$","p","4-Authenticity online is now about long-term commitment and consistency. These people have that in spades. Marie Kondo is a dedicated and inspiring minimalist, but I’m not sure if her life philosophy has resulted in [multiple encounters with law enforcement.](https://3mules.com/category/police-encounters-2/)",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Authenticity online is now about long‑term commitment and consistency. These people have that in spades. Marie Kondo is a dedicated and inspiring minimalist, but I’m not sure if her life philosophy has resulted in ",["$","a","1",{"href":"https://3mules.com/category/police-encounters-2/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["multiple encounters with law enforcement."]}]]}]
16:["$","p","5-It may not necessarily be a better type of less, but it is definitely a *deeper* one. Here’s my working list. Let me know what I’m missing.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["It may not necessarily be a better type of less, but it is definitely a ",["$","em","1",{"children":["deeper"]}]," one. Here’s my working list. Let me know what I’m missing."]}]
17:["$","ul","list-6",{"className":"article-list","children":[["$","li","6-[100 Rabbits](https://100r.co/): Rekka Bellum and Devine Lu Linvega live and work aboard a 33-foot sailboat. What makes this different from lifestyle minimalism is that reduction is treated as an engineering/design problem: fewer electronics, repairable things, open-source software, food preservation, limited energy, sailing without unnecessary systems, making things yourself.",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://100r.co/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["100 Rabbits"]}],": Rekka Bellum and Devine Lu Linvega live and work aboard a 33‑foot sailboat. What makes this different from lifestyle minimalism is that reduction is treated as an engineering/design problem: fewer electronics, repairable things, open‑source software, food preservation, limited energy, sailing without unnecessary systems, making things yourself."]}],["$","li","7-[Low-tech Magazine](https://solar.lowtechmagazine.com/): A solar-powered site that asks how little energy, machinery and complexity are actually necessary to accomplish things. Recent material covers human-powered transport, extremely simple heating, solar cooking, passive cooling and adapting buildings seasonally rather than brute-forcing comfort mechanically.",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://solar.lowtechmagazine.com/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Low‑tech Magazine"]}],": A solar‑powered site that asks how little energy, machinery and complexity are actually necessary to accomplish things. Recent material covers human‑powered transport, extremely simple heating, solar cooking, passive cooling and adapting buildings seasonally rather than brute‑forcing comfort mechanically."]}],["$","li","8-[MiniMotives](https://minimotives.com/): Macy Miller’s site began around designing and building her own tiny house and became a long-running record of tiny housing as her actual life, including plans, construction, budgets, off-grid basics, family life and subsequent designs.",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://minimotives.com/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["MiniMotives"]}],": Macy Miller’s site began around designing and building her own tiny house and became a long‑running record of tiny housing as her actual life, including plans, construction, budgets, off‑grid basics, family life and subsequent designs."]}],["$","li","9-[3 Mules](https://3mules.com/): A man living continuously outdoors for decades, traveling with his mules. The site contains his sleeping locations, expenses, encounters with police, recipes, observations and an argument for the right to move through public space.",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://3mules.com/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["3 Mules"]}],": A man living continuously outdoors for decades, traveling with his mules. The site contains his sleeping locations, expenses, encounters with police, recipes, observations and an argument for the right to move through public space."]}],["$","li","10-[Hacker Bikepacker](https://hackerbikepacker.com/): Javier Carrasco Cruz combines remote software work with long-distance bicycle travel. His archive moves back and forth between Linux/kernel programming and crossing countries by bicycle, and includes his actual bikepacking equipment and routes.",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://hackerbikepacker.com/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Hacker Bikepacker"]}],": Javier Carrasco Cruz combines remote software work with long‑distance bicycle travel. His archive moves back and forth between Linux/kernel programming and crossing countries by bicycle, and includes his actual bikepacking equipment and routes."]}],"$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"]}]
