1b:["$","li","11-[Minafi](https://minafi.com/): Adam Fortuna explicitly defines the project as the intersection of financial independence + minimalism + mindfulness, with minimalism meaning living with what provides value and eliminating what doesn’t.",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://minafi.com/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Minafi"]}],": Adam Fortuna explicitly defines the project as the intersection of financial independence + minimalism + mindfulness, with minimalism meaning living with what provides value and eliminating what doesn’t."]}]
1c:["$","li","12-[Tenth Acre Farm](https://www.tenthacrefarm.com/): Instead of assuming self-sufficiency requires buying acreage and disappearing into the wilderness, it’s about producing useful things and increasing resilience on an ordinary small residential property.",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://www.tenthacrefarm.com/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Tenth Acre Farm"]}],": Instead of assuming self‑sufficiency requires buying acreage and disappearing into the wilderness, it’s about producing useful things and increasing resilience on an ordinary small residential property."]}]
1d:["$","li","13-[Mind of a Hitchhiker](https://mindofahitchhiker.com/) — Iris Veldwijk has built an enormous personal archive around long-term hitchhiking, kayaking and a life made possible by carrying relatively little and improvising infrastructure as you move.",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://mindofahitchhiker.com/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Mind of a Hitchhiker"]}]," — Iris Veldwijk has built an enormous personal archive around long‑term hitchhiking, kayaking and a life made possible by carrying relatively little and improvising infrastructure as you move."]}]
